  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n frac{{119 - [ { 48 ÷ 6 - 7 left{ {5 × 12 ÷ 3 - ( {15 - overline {3 - 8} } )} right}} ]}}{{24 ÷ 3 - 9 of 3 + ( {52 - overline {8 - 4} } ) ÷ 6 }}\n\n⇒ 119 – [48 ÷ 6 – 7{5 × 12 ÷ 3 – (15 + 5)}]/24 ÷ 3 – 9 of 3 + (52 – 4) ÷ 6\n\n⇒ 119 – [48 ÷ 6 – 7{5 × 12 ÷ 3 – 20}]/24 ÷ 3 – 9 of 3 + 48 ÷ 6\n\n⇒ 119 – [8 – 7{5 × 12 ÷ 3 – 20}]/24 ÷ 3 – 9 of 3 + 48 ÷ 6\n\n⇒ 119 – [8 – 7(5 × 12 ÷ 3 – 20}]/24 ÷ 3 – 9 of 3 + 48 ÷ 6\n\n⇒ 119 – [8 – 7(5 × 4 – 20)]/24 ÷ 3 – 9 of 3 + 48 ÷ 6\n\n⇒ 119 – [8 – 7(20 – 20)]/24 ÷ 3 – 27 + 48 ÷ 6\n\n⇒ 119 – 8/(8 – 27 + 8) \n\n⇒ 111/(-11)\n\n⇒ -111/11\n\n**∴ The required value is -111/11**\n\nba:",
